    "result_text": "All 268 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nWhen an owner is created (or otherwise returned), the response now includes a `displayName` field formatted as `LastName, FirstName`.\n\nChanges made:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `displayName` property (readOnly string) to the `Owner` response schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Populated `displayName` when mapping `Owner \u2192 OwnerDto` via a MapStruct expression backed by a `displayName(Owner)` helper that formats `getLastName() + \", \" + getFirstName()`.\n\nThe `addOwner` controller already maps the saved owner through `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(...)`, so the computed display name flows into the create response automatically (and into all other owner responses). Full suite: 268 tests, 0 failures.",
